<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">empathic-shroud</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Empathic Shroud</ansi> spell wraps the target in a psionic veil woven
from Chrysalis energy, bending perception around them and making them
difficult to notice. Enemies struggle to focus on a shrouded target.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast empathic-shroud [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 6
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Stealth/concealment buff — makes the target harder to
                 perceive

